# Public std modules and their stability (ADR-0056 section 1.2). One per line: <module> <frozen|experimental|builtin>.
# frozen: an API change needs an ADR or a changes/ note. experimental: changes allowed, update the snapshot.
# builtin: loader built-in over the C runtime, no source file, so no snapshot (listed for completeness).
# std:fs/host/io/time/net are frozen only if criterion C5 is met; until then they are snapshotted as frozen so changes show.
# std:task is frozen for the Gate 1 API only; additions beyond it are experimental, so the whole module is marked experimental.
# std:json/legacy is frozen but deprecated.
std:bytes frozen
std:collections frozen
std:encoding frozen
std:fs frozen
std:graph frozen
std:host frozen
std:html experimental
std:http frozen
std:io frozen
std:json frozen
std:json/decode frozen
std:json/legacy frozen
std:json/number frozen
std:math frozen
std:meta experimental
std:net frozen
std:ox experimental
std:path frozen
std:process builtin
std:seq frozen
std:task experimental
std:test frozen
std:text frozen
std:time frozen
std:url frozen
std:utf8 frozen
